<p class="cap">From his SoundCloud, as listed there on 16 November 2026: the two themes he published in 2023, and a playlist called Media of cues tagged film score and TV. "1M25" is how film music names a cue: reel 1, music cue 25. Which films and series WF, TG and TB stand for: <span class="tbc">to confirm</span><sup class="s"><a href="#s7">7</a></sup></p>
